= William Turner
{parent=List of anatomists}
{c}
{title2=1832–1916}

An <anatomist> whose 1863 lecture discussed the origins of cells in pathological lesions. Portrait catalogue: https://content.www.wellcomecollection.org/works/npd984jh[Wellcome Collection M0016782, identified portrait, after an 1881 photograph].

